# Running from the first watchdog (step 2: the chase and the search). Booted on 0B00, inside its
# loop, facing south as it comes up column 0 towards you (watchdogs.steps). As its beam reaches
# you, turn and run north, then east along row A behind the guard page at column 1, row B: it
# chases (wd C on the debug line's row 8), loses you, and searches (S), then goes back (R, P)
boot_at 0B00
wait_up
wait 0.5
hold right 0.5
wait 12.5
shot we_00_coming
hold left 1.0
keydown up
wait 0.5
shot we_01_run
wait 0.5
shot we_02
wait 0.5
shot we_03
keydown left
wait 0.5
keyup left
shot we_04_turned
wait 0.5
shot we_05
wait 0.5
shot we_06
wait 0.5
shot we_07
keyup up
wait 1.0
shot we_08
wait 1.0
shot we_09
wait 1.0
shot we_10
wait 2.0
shot we_11
wait 2.0
shot we_12
wait 3.0
shot we_13
wait 3.0
shot we_14
